e during its term of use.\n\n### **5. Compliance with Laws and Regulations**\nThe Patient agrees to comply with all applicable laws, regulations, and standards concerning the manufacture, labeling, packaging, storage, transportation, marketing, and use of the Device. Failure to do so may result in civil penalties, criminal sanctions, or both.\n\n### **6. Termination**\nThis Prescription may be terminated by either party upon written notice if there has been a material breach of this Prescription by the other party. Upon termination, the Patient must immediately cease all use of the Device and return it to the Manufacturer for proper disposal.\n\n### **7. Governing Law**\nThis Prescription shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of [State], without regard to conflicts of law principles.\n\n### **8",
